sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant N as New Project
    participant C as Charter Service
    participant F as Factory Workflow
    participant S as SDD Workbench
    participant E as Email Provider

    U->>N: Confirm approved project contract
    N->>C: Materialize approved brief and intake
    C-->>N: Markdown, metadata, digest
    N->>F: Start full generation
    F->>C: Verify approval and digest
    F-->>S: Generate traceable implementation and SDD
    U->>S: Read charter on mobile
    U->>S: Share complete document
    S->>E: Send charter to recipients

